                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Are YouTube ads worth it for D2C?</h3>
                                        <p>For consideration categories (beauty, wellness, jewelry, electronics): yes — compounds slowly but durably. For impulse categories (fashion, F&B): supplementary to Meta / Google.</p>
                                        <h3>Shorts or TrueView — which is better?</h3>
                                        <p>Both. Shorts for prospecting + Gen-Z brand awareness. TrueView for consideration + qualified engagement. Combined stack works best.</p>
                                        <h3>Is Performance Max better than manual YouTube campaigns?</h3>
                                        <p>For most D2C: yes. PMax uses YouTube inventory alongside Search + Shopping + Discover with better cross-format optimisation.</p>
                                        <h3>How much should I spend on YouTube?</h3>
                                        <p>Growth-stage: 10-20% of paid budget for consideration categories. Impulse categories: 5-10%. Test then scale.</p>
